					<ul>
<li>Includes all new features and bug fixes up to Obsidian Desktop 1.14.4.</li>
</ul>
<h2>No longer broken</h2>
<ul>
<li>Bases: Fixed kanban view not scrolling horizontally when every card is hidden.</li>
<li>Bases: Fixed table view losing its horizontal scroll position when the pull-down action is triggered.</li>
<li>Bases: Fixed kanban columns resizing on mobile when the keyboard opens or closes.</li>
<li>Bases: Opening the view configuration page no longer automatically focuses the view name.</li>
<li>Bases: “Add view” command now automatically focuses the view name input.</li>
</ul>

