					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="md:basis-3/4">
				
				<div class="typeset break-words" dir="ltr">
					<ul>
<li>Includes all new features and bug fixes up to Obsidian Desktop 1.14.3.</li>
</ul>
<h2>New</h2>
<ul>
<li>iOS: Added template support to Quick Capture when its behavior is set to daily note or a selected note.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Improvements</h2>
<ul>
<li>Bases: Improved the toolbar layout. Groups, Sort, Properties, and Results now appear inside a single “Display” toolbar menu item.</li>
</ul>
<h2>No longer broken</h2>
<ul>
<li>iOS: Fixed a crash when launching the app on iOS 17 and earlier.</li>
<li>iOS: Fixed Quick Capture saving new notes in the same folder as the current file when the vault root is selected.</li>
<li>iOS: Fixed the Quick Capture location sheet not matching the active color scheme.</li>
<li>iOS: Fixed syllables sometimes disappearing while typing in Korean.</li>
<li>Fixed “Setup Obsidian Sync” on the vault chooser screen loading forever after your login expired.</li>
</ul>

				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
		
		<div class="flex py-16 flex-col md:flex-row">
			<div class="grow">
				<div class="md:sticky md:top-[var(--header-height)]">
					<a href="/changelog/2026-09-29-desktop-v1.14.3/" class="font-semibold text-3xl sm:text-xl">
						September 29, 2026
					</a>
					<div class="font-mono mt-2 text-muted">
						<a href="/changelog/2026-09-29-desktop-v1.14.3/" class="flex items-center gap-4">
							<span class="text-sm">1.14.3
								
									<span span class=""> Desktop</span>
								
							</span>
						</a>
					</div>
					<div class="mb-8 mt-3 text-xs text-muted font-mono">
						
							<a href="/pricing#catalyst"><span class="bg-accent-900 text-accent-300 py-0.5 px-2 rounded-xl">catalyst</span></a>
						
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="md:basis-3/4">
				
				<div class="typeset break-words" dir="ltr">
					<h2>New</h2>
<ul>
<li>Added Quick Look previews for Markdown files on macOS (requires latest installer).</li>
<li>Added document icons on macOS and Windows for <code>.md</code>, <code>.base</code> and <code>.canvas</code>.</li>
<li>Bases: Added a <strong>Group</strong> menu to the toolbar for choosing the property to group by. Use it to reorder, hide, and add groups by hand in any view type.</li>
<li>Redesigned empty state and added “New base” and “New canvas” when their plugins are enabled.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Improvements</h2>
<ul>
<li>Added “Increase font size” and “Decrease font size” commands.</li>
<li>Added an update notice in <strong>Settings → General</strong> when a newer installer is available.</li>
<li>Bases: Improved how dates and times are rendered in group headers and in readonly layouts (e.g. Cards, Kanban).</li>
<li>Bases: Embedded kanban boards no longer have a fixed height.</li>
<li>Improved fuzzy search in the Quick switcher and suggestions: matches where your letters start words now rank higher, and searching is faster in large vaults.</li>
<li>When opening an untrusted vault, themes and snippets will be temporarily disabled while the “Do you trust the author of this vault” dialog is on screen.</li>
<li>Improved search in the Bookmarks, Outline, Tags, and Sync views. Everything inside a matching item now stays visible. Groups with nothing to show are hidden.</li>
<li>In Source mode, pressing <code>ArrowUp</code> on the first line of a note now moves the cursor to the inline title, like in Live Preview.</li>
</ul>
<h2>No longer broken</h2>
<ul>
<li>Fixed tooltips briefly disappearing when moving between adjacent items.</li>
<li>Fixed kanban column count missing thousands separators.</li>
<li>Bases: Fixed a long property name in a filter rule pushing the operator and value out of view.</li>
<li>Bases: Fixed “Hide all” causing the properties menu to render incorrectly.</li>
<li>Fixed a potential iframe injection in the Slides plugin.</li>
<li>Fixed page preview showing behind Bases toolbar menus.</li>
<li>Fixed an editor issue with <code>Home</code> and <code>End</code> key in RTL languages.</li>
<li>Fixed searching headings in all notes (<code>[[##</code>) freezing the app in large vaults.</li>
<li>Fixed pressing <code>Enter</code> on an invalid title in an embedded note (e.g. a new note from Bases) reverting the title and moving focus out of it. The title now stays focused so you can fix the name.</li>
<li>Canvas: Fixed a card narrowed to a heading or block still showing that section after using <strong>Swap file…</strong> to pick the same file.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Developers</h2>
<ul>
<li>The installer has been updated to Electron v43.7.5.</li>
<li>Added CSS variables for tooltips, notices, hotkeys, and tabs, using the prefixes <code>--tooltip-</code>, <code>--notice-</code>, <code>--hotkey</code>, <code>--tab-inner-</code> and <code>--tab-container-</code>.</li>
</ul>

				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
		
