							<a href="/pricing#catalyst"><span class="bg-accent-900 text-accent-300 py-0.5 px-2 rounded-xl">catalyst</span></a>
						
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="md:basis-3/4">
				
				<div class="typeset break-words" dir="ltr">
					<ul>
<li>Includes all new features and bug fixes up to Obsidian Desktop 1.14.2.</li>
</ul>
<h2>New</h2>
<ul>
<li>iOS 27: Added support for the new extra large Quick Capture and View Note widgets.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Improvements</h2>
<ul>
<li>iOS: Quick Capture’s color scheme now matches the active vault’s color scheme.</li>
</ul>
<h2>No longer broken</h2>
<ul>
<li>Bases: Fixed exporting a view as a CSV file.</li>
<li>Fixed the vault switcher not always showing a dark keyboard.</li>
<li>iOS: Fixed Quick Capture not always having initial input focus.</li>
<li>iOS: Fixed Quick Capture not being available for a few seconds after closing the app when the vault is large.</li>
<li>iOS: Fixed the progress bar briefly flashing during startup.</li>
<li>iOS: Fixed the Share Sheet generating invalid filenames for Instagram posts.</li>
<li>Android: Fixed the splash screen rendering incorrectly.</li>
<li>Android: Fixed the “Take picture” navigation bar item not always giving the option to take a photo directly from the app.</li>
<li>Tablet: Fixed a layout regression in the Debug dialog.</li>
</ul>

				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
		
		<div class="flex py-16 flex-col md:flex-row">
			<div class="grow">
				<div class="md:sticky md:top-[var(--header-height)]">
					<a href="/changelog/2026-09-15-desktop-v1.14.2/" class="font-semibold text-3xl sm:text-xl">
						September 15, 2026
					</a>
					<div class="font-mono mt-2 text-muted">
						<a href="/changelog/2026-09-15-desktop-v1.14.2/" class="flex items-center gap-4">
							<span class="text-sm">1.14.2
								
									<span span class=""> Desktop</span>
								
							</span>
						</a>
					</div>
					<div class="mb-8 mt-3 text-xs text-muted font-mono">
						
							<a href="/pricing#catalyst"><span class="bg-accent-900 text-accent-300 py-0.5 px-2 rounded-xl">catalyst</span></a>
						
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="md:basis-3/4">
				
				<div class="typeset break-words" dir="ltr">
					<h2>New</h2>
<p>You can now open files from outside your vault in Obsidian. The file opens in your current window (Desktop only).</p>
<ul>
<li>Added the “Open file from outside the vault…” command. Pick any file on your computer and view it in the app.</li>
<li>Obsidian now appears in your operating system’s <strong>Open with</strong> menu, and you can set it as the default app for Markdown files (requires downloading the latest installer).</li>
</ul>
<h2>Improvements</h2>
<ul>
<li>All in-app links now take you to the localized version of the Obsidian website.</li>
<li>Base font size is no longer saved to <code>appearance.json</code>. It is now stored in the device’s local storage, so it no longer syncs with Obsidian Sync.</li>
<li>Improved drag and drop in the kanban layout and File Explorer. The view now smoothly scrolls when dragging near the edge.</li>
<li>The editor link suggestions (e.g. <code>[[</code>) and the quick switcher no longer switch to a simplified algorithm in vaults with more than 10,000 files. Fuzzy matching is now always used.</li>
<li>Format converter: Removed old formats from the converter plugin.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Bases</h3>
<ul>
<li>Kanban: Cards can now be moved between folder columns when grouped by <code>file.folder</code>.</li>
<li>Kanban: Creating a note in a column now places it in the corresponding folder when grouped by <code>file.folder</code>.</li>
<li>Kanban: Added error feedback when moving a card fails, such as when the note has invalid properties or the target folder is missing.</li>
</ul>
<h2>No longer broken</h2>
<ul>
<li>Editor: Fixed Markdown formatting characters not parsing correctly around emails (e.g. <code>*Some email: <a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection" class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="ea988b848e8587aa8f928b879a868fc4898587">[email&#160;protected]</a>*</code>).</li>
<li>Editor: Fixed clicking on collapsed reference links (e.g. <code>[link][]</code>) going to the wrong destination.</li>
<li>Bases: Fixed page preview showing the wrong height when previewing a kanban view.</li>
<li>Fixed incorrect language code used for Khmer.</li>
</ul>

				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
		
		<div class="flex py-16 flex-col md:flex-row">
			<div class="grow">
				<div class="md:sticky md:top-[var(--header-height)]">
