					<div class="font-mono mt-2 text-muted">
						<a href="/changelog/2026-09-08-mobile-v1.14.1/" class="flex items-center gap-4">
							<span class="text-sm">1.14.1
								
									<span span class=""> Mobile</span>
								
							</span>
						</a>
					</div>
					<div class="mb-8 mt-3 text-xs text-muted font-mono">
						
							<a href="/pricing#catalyst"><span class="bg-accent-900 text-accent-300 py-0.5 px-2 rounded-xl">catalyst</span></a>
						
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="md:basis-3/4">
				
				<div class="typeset break-words" dir="ltr">
					<ul>
<li>Includes all new features and bug fixes up to Obsidian Desktop 1.14.1.</li>
</ul>
<h2>New</h2>
<ul>
<li>iOS 26: Added a configurable Quick Capture Home Screen widget. Add shortcuts to capture directly to different Locations.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Improvements</h2>
<ul>
<li>Text and interface elements now scale with your system’s preferred text size, including larger accessibility sizes.</li>
<li>iOS: Quick Capture widgets on the Lock Screen and in Control Center can now be configured to open a specific Location.</li>
<li>iOS: The Quick Capture action in Shortcuts now supports a Location parameter.</li>
<li>iOS: Quick Capture templates now support <code>{{openStreetMapLink}}</code> to insert an OpenStreetMap link to your current position.</li>
<li>iOS: Improved the layout of Quick Capture’s Live Activity in the expanded Dynamic Island.</li>
</ul>
<h2>No longer broken</h2>
<ul>
<li>Fixed back and forward swipe gestures being reversed in right-to-left languages.</li>
<li>iPad: Fixed incorrect app and status bar sizing when resizing windows in Split View or Stage Manager.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Developers</h2>
<ul>
<li>Use <code>--font-preferred-size</code> for text that should respect the system’s preferred text size. On mobile, it combines <code>--font-text-size</code> with the <code>--preferred-text-scale</code> multiplier.</li>
</ul>

				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
		
		<div class="flex py-16 flex-col md:flex-row">
			<div class="grow">
				<div class="md:sticky md:top-[var(--header-height)]">
					<a href="/changelog/2026-09-08-desktop-v1.14.1/" class="font-semibold text-3xl sm:text-xl">
						September 8, 2026
					</a>
					<div class="font-mono mt-2 text-muted">
						<a href="/changelog/2026-09-08-desktop-v1.14.1/" class="flex items-center gap-4">
							<span class="text-sm">1.14.1
								
									<span span class=""> Desktop</span>
								
							</span>
