							<a href="/pricing#catalyst"><span class="bg-accent-900 text-accent-300 py-0.5 px-2 rounded-xl">catalyst</span></a>
						
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
			<div class="md:basis-3/4">
				
				<div class="typeset break-words" dir="ltr">
					<h2>Improvements</h2>
<ul>
<li>Math rendering now uses MathJax 4.1.3, replacing MathJax 3 and Temml.</li>
<li>Bases: Added right-to-left (RTL) support to table views, including keyboard navigation, selections, and horizontal scrolling.</li>
</ul>
<h2>No longer broken</h2>
<ul>
<li>Fixed default file to open option not working.</li>
<li>Fixed opening recent vault from OS menu not working.</li>
<li>Vim: Fixed deleting and pasting a numbered list item inserting blank lines and empty numbered items.</li>
<li>Fixed input hover styles in the quick switcher and command palette.</li>
<li>RTL: Fixed the loading animation in right-to-left languages.</li>
</ul>

